     A* SCRIPTURA DATA DETAIL WORK FILE FOR BILLING INOVICE           *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  150WBV       PROGRAMMER:  C:291                    *
     A*  CREATED:  03/19/18                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  This is the work file to hold the data for     *
     A*                Billing Invoice - Summary work file            *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  Summary type BSTYPE:                                         *
     A*  SW - Summary of Wages                                        *
     A*  SR - Summary by reporting period                             *
     A*  TR - Total of all the Reporting periods                      *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PBS01                     TEXT('SUMMARY INVOICE WORKFILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*  XML LINK CODE - SAME AS HEADER FILE
     A            BSXML         60          COLHDG('XML KEY')
      * Summary type: SW - Summary of Wages, SR - Summary by reporting period
      *               TR - Total of all the Reporting periods
     A            BSTYPE         2          COLHDG('SUMMARY TYPE')
     A*
     A            BSCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            BSFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            BSEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            BSDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            BSFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A*
     A            BSPOLNBR      25          COLHDG('MAIN POLICY #')
     A            BSPOLNBRI     25          COLHDG('INDIVIDUAL POLICY #')

     A            BSRPTPRD       7  0       COLHDG('REPORTING PERIOD')
     A            BSRPTPRDM      5  0       COLHDG('REPORTING PRD MTH')

      * Manual premium Total for Summary of Wages and Summary by Reporting period
     A            BSMANPREM     11  2       COLHDG('MANUAL PREMIUM')

      * Wage amount, Link code and State for Summary of Wages
     A            BSWAGEAMT     11  2       COLHDG('WAGE AMT')
     A            BSEMPLNK      15          COLHDG('EMPLOYER' 'LINK CODE')
     A            BSSTATE        2          COLHDG('STATE')

      * Manual Premium % and Amount Due for Summary by Reporting period
     A            BSMANPPCT      5  2       COLHDG('PCT' 'MAN PRM')
     A            BSAMTDUE      11  2       COLHDG('AMOUNT DUE')

      * Premium Due, Collateral Due and Grand Total
     A            BSPRMDUE      11  2       COLHDG('PREMIUM' 'DUE')
     A            BSCOLDUE      11  2       COLHDG('COLLATERAL' 'DUE')
     A            BSGRDTOT      11  2       COLHDG('GRAND TOTAL')
     A*
